From e8ab3f1e79fa1cc8eebd959bfccbef16da239cd6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 01:13:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(skills): add the pr-flow skill (#4867)

Adapt the Inspector's pr-flow skill for this repo: read the issue and
every comment, assign it and move the card to In Progress, branch
v2/<type>/<N>-<slug> from origin/v2/main (stacking included), sign off
every commit (DCO, with the rebase --signoff repair and why
format.signOff does nothing), run the gate, record client evidence in
place of screenshots, open the PR with Closes #N first and link it with
addCloseIssueReferences, move the card to In Review, and run the Copilot
review loop to one of its four documented exits (clean round,
out-of-scope only, two silent rounds, timeout). Close-out on merge is
by hand, with the card moved to Done.

The DCO app is not installed yet, so the skill says so and AGENTS.md
does not gain the signoff rule; that waits for the app to enforce it.

Adds the skills-index row and the timeout exit to AGENTS.md, plus eight
eval cases (six positive, two negative), all passing at RUNS=5.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
